<component #resource_core.loader apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/xnl-resource-tree" "behavior://resource-loading/requirements/loader-content-identities" "behavior://resource-authoring/requirements/xnl-resource-language" "behavior://xnl-product-closure/requirements/no-product-xml"] } [
  <desc ?01M02KBYHBMTPMEQTQYGVN1KKJ>
  单次读取 XNL authority bytes，完成 fatal UTF-8 decode、解析、containment/Kind/identity 校验和 raw-byte SHA-256 identity 投影；只返回由当前 loader 建立的 authentic LoadedResourceTree，不存在 XML fallback。
  </?01M02KBYHBMTPMEQTQYGVN1KKJ>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  interface ResourceCoreRuntime { readFileBytes: ReadFileBytes; readDirectory: ReadDirectory; realpath: Realpath; xnlParser: XnlParser; sha256: Sha256 }
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  interface LoadResourceTreeInput { rootDir: string; manifestPath?: "manifest.xnl" }
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  interface ResourceCoreConfig { canonicalManifest: "manifest.xnl"; textEncoding: "utf-8-fatal"; digest: "sha256" }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  type LoadResourceTreeOutput = LoadedResourceTree | readonly ResourceDiagnostic[]
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "ctrl" } ?ctrl>
  单次读取 raw bytes → fatal UTF-8 decode + raw SHA-256 → 解析/验证 XNL roots → 注册 ResourceRecord → 为每个业务 resource 建 identity → 冻结并登记 LoadedResourceTree
  </?ctrl>
]>

<object #resource_core.resource_record apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "entity" fact_grade = "derived_projection_cache" single_writer = "modeling://domain/resource_core/loader" } [
  <desc ?01M02KBYHBMTPMEQTQYGVN1KKK>
  由 XNL authority 可重建的通用资源记录；身份与 apiVersion 是共同边界，description/lifecycle 等业务属性由具体 Kind 拥有并可缺省。
  </?01M02KBYHBMTPMEQTQYGVN1KKK>
  <types ?types>
  interface ResourceRecord {
      resourceId: string
      kind: string
      description?: string
      metadata: { apiVersion: string; version?: string; lifecycle?: string }
      node: ResourceNode
      documentUri: string
      logicalPath: string
      sourceShape: "single-file" | "directory" | "manifest"
    }
  </?types>
  <fact-source ?01M02KBYHBMTPMEQTQYGVN1KKM>
  事实源是资源作者拥有的 XNL 文档；registry 保留字段存在或缺失的事实，是只读派生投影，不填充虚假默认值，也不反写 authority。
  </?01M02KBYHBMTPMEQTQYGVN1KKM>
]>

<object #resource_core.loaded_resource_tree apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "entity" fact_grade = "derived_projection_cache" single_writer = "modeling://domain/resource_core/loader" } [
  <desc ?desc>
  ResourceTree 的 additive loader 输出 subtype；contentIdentities 精确覆盖 registry business resources，既不是第二份 authoring authority，也不把 identities 变成 structural ResourceTree 的必填字段。
  </?desc>
  <types ?types>
  interface LoadedResourceTree extends ResourceTree {
    readonly contentIdentities: ReadonlyMap&lt;string, ResourceContentIdentity&gt;
  }
  </?types>
  <invariants ?invariants>
  只由 canonical loader 创建并在当前 runtime 登记；authorityDigest 来自同次读取的 raw bytes；forest roots 可共享 authorityDigest，但 resourceId/contentDigest 必须独立；manifest、KindDefinition 与 tombstone 不进入此 map；输出不可变。
  </?invariants>
  <fact-source ?source>
  事实源是 ResourcePackage catalog 实际加载的 XNL authority bytes；本对象是可重建 projection。
  </?source>
]>

<component #resource_core.effective_content_identity_projector apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/loader-content-identities"] } [
  <desc ?desc>
  根据 authentic effective registry 的 exact layer/origin facts，从 authentic loaded trees 选择所有 present effective resource identities，并只合并 Kind owner 显式提供的 typed contributions。
  </?desc>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  type EffectiveContentIdentityRuntime = Readonly&lt;Record&lt;never, never&gt;&gt;
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  interface ResolveEffectiveResourceContentIdentitiesInput {
    registry: EffectiveResourceRegistry
    layers: readonly ResourceLayerContentIdentityInput[]
    contributions?: ReadonlyMap&lt;string, readonly ResourceDigestContribution[]&gt;
  }
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  interface EffectiveContentIdentityConfig { layerBinding: "exact"; ordering: "utf16-code-unit"; partial: "reject" }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  type EffectiveContentIdentityOutput = ReadonlyMap&lt;string, ResourceContentIdentity&gt; | readonly ResourceDiagnostic[]
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "dataflow" } ?dataflow>
  验证 registry/tree authenticity → 核对 layer 顺序与 package identity → 按 effective origin 选择 authority identity → 合并显式 contributions → 拒绝 missing/extra/conflict → 稳定排序并冻结 map
  </?dataflow>
]>

<component #resource_core.layered_registry apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/layered-effective-registry"] } [
  <desc ?desc>
  将多个已验证 ResourceTree 按调用方给定的 named layer 顺序组合成 effective registry；只处理显式 shadow/tombstone 与 Kind contract 冲突，不扫描文件、不绑定 host 路径。
  </?desc>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  type LayeredRegistryRuntime = Readonly<Record<never, never>>
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  interface ComposeLayeredRegistryInput {
    layers: readonly ResourceLayerInput[]
  }
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  interface ComposeLayeredRegistryConfig {
    precedence: "input-low-to-high"
    kindDefinitionConflict: "reject"
  }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  type ComposeLayeredRegistryOutput = EffectiveResourceRegistry | readonly ResourceDiagnostic[]
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "ctrl" } ?ctrl>
  校验 layer ids → 低到高合并资源 → 应用显式 tombstones → 拒绝 identity/kind/KindDefinition 冲突 → UTF-16 code-unit 稳定排序 → 计算 composition revision → deep-clone/freeze 输出
  </?ctrl>
]>

<object #resource_core.effective_resource_registry apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "entity" fact_grade = "derived_projection_cache" single_writer = "modeling://domain/resource_core/layered_registry" } [
  <desc ?desc>
  从 ordered named layers 可重建的只读有效资源视图；effective 资源与 shadow/tombstone provenance 同时保留，既不是新的 authoring authority，也不反写任一 layer。
  </?desc>
  <types ?types>
  interface EffectiveResourceRegistry {
    layers: readonly ResourceLayerDescriptor[]
    byId: ReadonlyMap<string, EffectiveResourceEntry>
    byKind: ReadonlyMap<string, readonly ResourceRecord[]>
    kindDefinitions: ReadonlyMap<string, EffectiveKindDefinition>
    compositionRevision: string
    revision: string
  }
  </?types>
  <invariants ?invariants>
  layer 顺序由输入显式给定；absence 不是删除；跨 kind identity 冲突和不兼容 KindDefinition 必须拒绝；机器绝对路径不得进入 revision；revision 是 compositionRevision 的精确兼容别名；compositionRevision 只绑定 identity/presence/layer/shadow/tombstone、选定 KindDefinition resourceId/contract 与 canonical documentUri/logicalPath provenance，不绑定 descriptor/node/metadata bytes；兼容 Kind contract 合并不以 definition resourceId 判冲突；投影不得保留指向调用方可变 record/node/KindDefinition 的引用。
  </?invariants>
  <fact-source ?source>
  事实源是各 layer 的 XNL ResourcePackage 和显式 tombstone 输入；本节点只是 #resource_core.layered_registry 的确定性投影。
  </?source>
]>

<component #resource_core.dependency_snapshot apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/resource-dependency-snapshot"] } [
  <desc ?desc>
  从 effective registry、显式 roots、typed dependency edges 与 digest contributions 构建可复现依赖闭包；不解析任意 ResourceNode 字符串，不拥有 Kind-specific 引用语义。
  </?desc>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  interface DependencySnapshotRuntime {
    canonicalDigest: CanonicalDigest
  }
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  interface BuildDependencySnapshotInput {
    registry: EffectiveResourceRegistry
    roots: readonly string[]
    edges: readonly ResourceDependencyEdge[]
    contentIdentities: ReadonlyMap<string, ResourceContentIdentity>
  }
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  interface BuildDependencySnapshotConfig {
    algorithm: "sha256"
    missingTarget: "reject"
    cycle: "reject"
  }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  type BuildDependencySnapshotOutput = ResourceDependencySnapshot | readonly ResourceDiagnostic[]
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "dataflow" } ?dataflow>
  重新校验全部 effective content identities 并重算 digest → 校验显式 roots/typed edges → 从 roots 求闭包 → 拒绝缺失端点/环/矛盾或伪造 digest → UTF-16 code-unit canonical 排序与摘要 → 输出 immutable snapshot
  </?dataflow>
]>

<object #resource_core.resource_dependency_snapshot apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "entity" fact_grade = "checkpoint_snapshot" single_writer = "modeling://domain/resource_core/dependency_snapshot" } [
  <desc ?desc>
  某组 roots 在一个 effective registry revision 上的不可变资源闭包证据，携带参与资源、typed edges、content revisions 与 snapshot revision。
  </?desc>
  <types ?types>
  interface ResourceDependencySnapshot {
    roots: readonly string[]
    closure: readonly SnapshotResource[]
    edges: readonly ResourceDependencyEdge[]
    registryRevision: string
    snapshotRevision: string
  }
  </?types>
  <invariants ?invariants>
  snapshot 只接受 canonical composer 登记的 immutable registry，只包含 typed edges 可达资源；普通字符串永不产生隐式边；registryRevision 绑定 compositionRevision 与全部 effective content digests；snapshotRevision 再绑定 roots、可达闭包与参与边；snapshot origin 必须独立复制冻结；相同语义输入必须产生相同 revision。
  </?invariants>
  <fact-source ?source>
  事实源是 #resource_core.effective_resource_registry、Kind owner 提供的 typed edges 和显式 authority/material digest contributions。
  </?source>
]>

<object #resource_core.code_package_binding apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "entity" fact_grade = "derived_projection_cache" single_writer = "modeling://domain/resource_core/code_package_loader" } (
  <desc ?01M0TCJ1W65M9H7F9YFQ4MZDHC>
  从 code-package XNL descriptor 的显式 CodeBinding 规范化得到的只读加载事实；XNL 与 entry bytes 仍是 authority，本对象不反写。
  </?01M0TCJ1W65M9H7F9YFQ4MZDHC>
  <types ?types>
  interface CodePackageBinding {
    readonly resourceId: string
    readonly moduleUri: `vfs://./${string}.js` | `vfs://./${string}.mjs`
    readonly exportName?: string
  }
  </?types>
  <invariants ?01M0TCJ1W65M9H7F9YFQ4MZDHD>
  只属于 sourceShape=code-package 的 record；每个 resource 恰有一个 binding；不携带机器绝对路径；moduleUri 必须 lexical-safe 且 realpath 闭合在 descriptor directory。
  </?01M0TCJ1W65M9H7F9YFQ4MZDHD>
  <fact-source ?01M0TCJ1W65M9H7F9YFQ4MZDHE>
  事实源是 CodePackage XNL descriptor 的 CodeBinding；#resource_core.code_package_loader 是唯一规范化者。
  </?01M0TCJ1W65M9H7F9YFQ4MZDHE>
)>

<component #resource_core.code_package_loader apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/code-package-source-shape" "behavior://resource-loading/requirements/code-package-module-loading"] } (
  <desc ?01M0TCJ1W76FQ2XYCR57PVHGTF>
  验证 code-package shape 与 binding、摘要 entry bytes、从 authentic tree 加载 revisioned module namespace，并通过 caller contract 做 target-neutral export admission。
